---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="w-full py-32 bg-brand-surface relative z-10" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <h2 id="about-heading" class="font-sora text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-text mb-8">
      Purposefully Minimal.
    </h2>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-muted font-inter leading-relaxed font-light">
      <p>
        Next G Solution is an independent software publisher dedicated to the craft of minimal digital experiences.
      </p>
      <p>
        We believe that games and applications should respect the user's time and attention. By stripping away unnecessary bloat, aggressive monetization, and visual noise, we focus entirely on usability, aesthetics, and pure performance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
